      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقَذٌّ</span></b>  <i>A blade for cutting or clipping;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقْرَاضٌ</span>; (S;) <i>an instrument for cutting the
